flowchart TD
    TRIGGER["user triggers feature (tap Scan / Enable alerts)"] --> CHECK{checkSelfPermission at use}
    CHECK -->|granted| PROCEED["run feature"]
    CHECK -->|not granted| STATE{shouldShowRationale?}
    STATE -->|true - denied, can ask| RATIONALE["show rationale UI -> request"]
    STATE -->|false + not asked yet| REQUEST["request directly (first time)"]
    STATE -->|false + already asked| PERMANENT["permanently denied -> deep-link to Settings (Ch 52)"]
    RATIONALE --> LAUNCH["Activity Result API launcher"]
    REQUEST --> LAUNCH
    LAUNCH --> RESULT{granted?}
    RESULT -->|yes| PROCEED
    RESULT -->|no| DEGRADE["disable feature gracefully + explain"]
    PREFER["prefer no-permission API: Photo Picker, approximate location"] -.-> TRIGGER
